text:
ana: quick UI check from the console review — on narrow widths the primary CTA in the toolbar is almost touching the search input. feels cramped and noisy. screenshot: https://img.redwood.example/console/toolbar-tight.png
kevin: yeah that's the compact spacing token in use. looks like `--space-compact: 6px`. for icon+label buttons 10px feels better.
priya: instead of changing the global compact token, can we add a toolbar-scoped token like `--space-toolbar-inline` to avoid regressions?
jon: +1. add `--space-toolbar-inline: 10px` and use it for adjacent CTAs. low blast radius.
kana: accessibility note: when that CTA launches the job we show a toast on error but it doesn't get announced by screen readers. can we make error toasts `role="alert"` and tabindex=0 so keyboard users can focus Retry?
kevin: agree. also the modal opened by the toolbar sometimes doesn't trap focus on iOS VoiceOver. modal needs `role="dialog"`, `aria-modal="true"` and focus the primary action on open.
priya: example modal handler suggestion:
```js
modal.onOpen(() => {
  modal.setAttribute('role', 'dialog');
  modal.setAttribute('aria-modal', 'true');
  const target = modal.querySelector("[data-autofocus]") || modal.querySelector('button, [href], input');
  if (target) target.focus();
});
```
jon: copy inconsistency: toolbar says "Run" but modal primary says "Start job". recommend standardizing on "Run job" across both.
kana: agreed — i'll update copy tokens to "Run job" and add a Storybook story at 320px showing the toolbar spacing and modal focus behavior. also will add an a11y story that demonstrates error toast receiving focus.
kevin: i'll add `--space-toolbar-inline: 10px` to tokens and wire the spacing in CSS. snapshot the toolbar at 320px in CI so we catch regressions.
priya: i'll prepare a small patch for toasts: error => `role=\"alert\" tabindex=\"0\"`, success => `aria-live=\"polite\"`. add tests to assert toast aria attributes.
design-bot: design token update pushed to Figma (Console Tokens) — https://figma.redwood.example/file/console-tokens (sync message)
jon: plan: 1) kevin adds token + story, 2) priya patches toasts, 3) kevin patches modal focus trap, 4) ana updates copy token to "Run job", 5) snapshots + axe smoke in CI. i'll open a tracking PR and tag reviewers. thanks all!
